{"3919730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pharaoh's Leap", "steam_appid": 3919730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this exciting platform game, you play as a brave mummy who awakens in ancient catacombs full of secrets and dangers. Your goal is to collect magic crystals scattered throughout the levels to activate the portal and move on to the next area. But the path will not be easy - deadly traps await you, such as sharp spikes, stone stakes falling from above and hidden mechanisms ready to work at any moment. The enemies guarding these places will not let you pass easily - skeletons, spirits and other creatures will pursue you, trying to stop you. Jump on platforms, dodge dangers, find hidden secrets and use your skills to get to the final portal and reveal the mystery of the ancient curse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre of the game - survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel graphics</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this exciting platform game, you play as a brave mummy who awakens in ancient catacombs full of secrets and dangers. Your goal is to collect magic crystals scattered throughout the levels to activate the portal and move on to the next area. But the path will not be easy - deadly traps await you, such as sharp spikes, stone stakes falling from above and hidden mechanisms ready to work at any moment. The enemies guarding these places will not let you pass easily - skeletons, spirits and other creatures will pursue you, trying to stop you. Jump on platforms, dodge dangers, find hidden secrets and use your skil